    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Malynowsky",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114897321473404976306/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKgmQiOIYyOyoQfftFuzdoa4nr_rkhEabie__fRQQNXtnGOPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Jonathan and his crew are extremely professional. They take great care of clients. Their work is honest and price is very fair. If you want REAL honest mechanic’s work to be done, please don’t shop anywhere else. They also work on luxury cars like MB, BMW. Thanks guys!",
        "time": 1712910822,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "James Petersen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106402701794089089509/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLArNU4U7UlE2XmN0--NbMxYHC7WxcovsUWekaQrSMi8wqU89o7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Great staff, excellent building. Brought my car in for the 100k service and new tires, they were able to let me know what work was required, what wasn't (timing chain means no replacement), and took care of my car well. While I waited, I used their free WiFi to do some work, while sitting in the quality chair at the provided desk. Owners and techs are knowledgeable, friendly, and HONEST with customers - I will be bringing my vehicles here from now on.",
        "time": 1684961103,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "dean truax",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114579093201714904879/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXX2aRgwgRw06L6mzEGiGG8Yr5WcW7PA1YdSM7BQYOk5J0xMWyb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Ive been going to Autotek for 10 years now. satisfaction garantied everytime. Very friendly team, and bilingual. they are equiped with all the modern technology for diagnosing every an any car. My Wife and i have had many cars and they always been able to complete our repaires within in the labour guide times that i found online and at half the price compared to the dealer. They even store our winter tires for us. They treat us very well. We moved  furthur away and we still go back to deal with them, they are the only ones we trust.  They also work on my brothers racecar, weve put theyre work to the test and trust me they have met the expectations.",
        "time": 1654688775,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stewart Fletcher Studios",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100879615361757636146/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUd6fOHg849u69quxPpU57x7RWyPP_WxB6YLZXFA4tofGfOZI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Honest, reliable and extraordinary service. Called them on a Friday afternoon with a leaking power-steering issue. Most shops close early, but at this place the mechanic waited for me to arrive well past closing and fixed the problem for me for the weekend. No extra charge. It's this kind of service that keeps me going there for all my car needs. When you have an older car you need a place like this!",
        "time": 1543432065,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liz Potvin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117446006302534521920/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXWm02DyUdOVdcCg2TnYkPgHb5lmh0u3Jo1ACv4RJhJkd0wwM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "THANK YOU! So much… I came here without an appointment because I got a rock on my windshield and I needed a fix right away, before it expanded.\nThe staff! AMAZING! Very helpful and kind, everyone was honest and did their best to help me.\nI can’t be thankful enough for such top notch job.",
        "time": 1652989430,
        "translated": false
      }
